[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（これは、アタシたちが海に出る前。\n\u3000騎士試験を受けた時のお話）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is a story from before we set out to sea. When I took the knight exam.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシがレスナちゃんとの約束を果たしたお話）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The story of how I fulfilled my promise to Resna.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ、はあ……思ったより速い！\nこのままじゃ逃げられちゃうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huff... huff... It's faster than I thought! At this rate, it'll get away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん、何よあのくらい。見てなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph, that's nothing. Just watch me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もらった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ！\u3000しぶといわね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch! You're a stubborn one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "止まればこっちのもの！\nやあああああ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once you stop moving, you're mine! YAAAAAH!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前らだけにいい思いさせてたまるかっての！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way I'm letting you two get all the glory!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ！\u3000危ないっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watch out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐああ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "臆病な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Timid Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "背中ががら空きっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your back is wide open!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう。ま、天才の手にかかればこんなものね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew. Well, when you've got a genius like me on the job, this is what happens!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あーあ。また手柄を取られちまったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Great. Someone else took the credit again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何よ。悪い？\u3000そもそも、最初に魔物を見つけたのも\n私なんだけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's your problem? I spotted the monster first, didn't I?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあまあ、魔物は倒せたんだから、\n誰の手柄かなんてどうでもいいでしょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, everyone! We defeated the monster, so who gets the credit doesn't matter!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなが頑張ったから倒せたということで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's just say we all worked together to bring it down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何甘いこと言ってんだ？\u3000これは試験なんだぜ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why so naive? This is an exam, remember?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰が試験官様に一番アピールできるかの勝負なんだ。\nいい子ちゃんは黙ってな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's about who can impress the examiners the most. Good little girls should keep quiet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いい子ちゃん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "G-good little girl...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "試験終了！\u3000皆休め",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exam complete! At ease, everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, ma'am!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先ほどの戦い、見ていたぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was watching your battle just now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なら一目瞭然よね！\u3000誰が一番活躍したか。\n倒したのもこの私――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then it's obvious, right? Who contributed the most? I'm the one who delivered the finishing blow—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだあの体たらくは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What was that disgraceful display?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "曲がりなりにも騎士を目指しているのだ。\nお前たちは、強いのだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're aspiring knights, are you not? You all possess strength, that much is clear."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし何か勘違いしているな。\n我々が求めているのはただ強いだけの人間ではない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you're misunderstanding something. We're not simply looking for strong individuals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "騎士として国を、そして民を守るにあたっては\n何よりも集団としての強さを発揮しなければならない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To protect our kingdom and its people as knights, you must demonstrate strength as a unit above all else."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このままでは騎士になれないと思え",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Continue like this, and none of you will become knights."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "肝に銘じます！\u3000ユナ殿！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll take your words to heart, Lady Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……では、次の試験会場に向かう。\nついてこい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Now, let's proceed to the next exam site. Follow me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, ma'am!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いよいよ訪れた、アタシにとって二回目の騎士試験。\n\u3000それは前回とはぜんぜん異なるものになっていた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And so came my second knight exam. This one was turning out completely different from the first.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ここ最近の出来事を踏まえて、\n\u3000王国はもっと騎士を増強したいんだって）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The kingdom wants to strengthen its knight forces based on recent events.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だからなのか、騎士試験も中身が一段と厳しいものに\n\u3000変わっていて、その試験を一緒に受けるのは……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe that's why the exam has gotten so much tougher. And the people taking it with me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何よ。私が倒したのに……！\nたくさん視線を感じたのに誰も見てないの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What gives? I took that monster down...! I felt so many eyes on me, but was nobody watching?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もっと力をつけないとな。\n集団なんてもんに頼らなくてもいいくらいに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need to get stronger. Strong enough that I don't need to rely on any group."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "横柄な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrogant Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……こんなことで怯えてちゃダメだろ、僕。\nしっかりしろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I can't keep being scared like this. Pull yourself together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "臆病な志願者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Timid Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（うーん、なんだかとっても不安だあ……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ugh, I'm getting really worried about this...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "騎士を目指す獣人の少女。レスナとの約束を\n果たすため、騎士試験に再挑戦する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A beast-girl aspiring to become a knight. She's taking the knight exam again to fulfill her promise to Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ・ココシュカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana Kokoschka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かつて鴉と呼ばれていた少女。よりレスナの役に\n立つため、イザナと共に騎士試験に参加した",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A girl once known as Crow. She joined the knight exam alongside Izana to become more useful to Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナ王国の白夜の騎士の一人。\n今回の騎士実技試験の試験監督を務める",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One of the Knights of the Midnight Sun of Lantarna Kingdom. She serves as the examiner for the practical knight examination."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ・ヴァイツ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna Waitz"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]